{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1114.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"8ca13654c2ff47df2c5b5a0a184b4c22b33a6f1cc2ad484268d09093518423ae","ja":"ロコモコプレート、おいしかった～♪\nお店もカワイくて、すっごくいい感じですよね。","zh":"ROCO摩可拼盘好好吃～♪\n店面也很可爱，感觉非常棒呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1114.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6313a1fae82944953bd195669cf153763aaa7a34728eb865c1aa8f7bad74c1f2","ja":"へへっ、気に入ってくれた？　BGMも\nゆったりしてて、すっごく癒されるんだよね。","zh":"嘿嘿，你喜欢吗？背景音乐也很\n舒缓，超级治愈呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1114.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d8083341d8220021fbcc1c5aa321f3a7551de4e2689518a3e1360843425eab8d","ja":"はい♪　レッスン頑張って疲れた体が、\n元気になっていくって感じがします♪","zh":"好的♪ 感觉上完课累坏了的身体，\n正在逐渐恢复活力呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1114.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"675086fabfc77b6f54040654760e438443884bf7cc5e2ecb0e96afe0eedeadf1","ja":"うふふっ。今日の翼ちゃん、\nすっごくレッスン頑張ってたものね。","zh":"呵呵。今天的翼，\n练习得特别努力呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1114.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"4570f8d5933579609915475e73f7aa84f3dee3680cce4ae7b4304e83f52f626d","ja":"翼につられて、なんだかわたくしも\nいつも以上に頑張れた気がしますわ。","zh":"受到翼的带动，不知为何我感觉自己\n也比平时更加努力了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1114.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"ee6070e8cbd166c51bd8260f4095dd37cdcea0b709e9ce2e1cc4cb764d0eae33","ja":"えへへ～。真さんとレストランって思ってたら、\nなんだか、いつもより元気になっちゃって……。","zh":"嘿嘿～。一想到要和真去餐厅，\n不知怎么就比平时更有精神了……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1114.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"4f2900a2567a461bd81aa6d31db68f378730f231ff52592bc6c5c2f42e1e035e","ja":"そうだ！　明日から、レッスンの後、\n毎日一緒にごはんに行きませんか？","zh":"我想到了！从明天起，练习结束后，\n要不要每天都一起去吃饭？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1114.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"7e97b60f238f0ace9c277313064bc33c416b64863fa46cab1ff291c5fb3232d2","ja":"えっ！　毎日！？","zh":"咦！　每天吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1114.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"68815b95bdadd57248911765f4235b4bd902cd89974ed2e98601f276fee9d364","ja":"はい！　それなら、毎日ず～っと\nレッスン頑張れるかもって！　ダメ？","zh":"好！要是那样的话，感觉每天都～能\n坚持上声乐课了！不行吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
